Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; 20 - Menus open at once and hover reactions come sooner.
; Windows waits 400 ms before it opens a sub-menu or reacts to the pointer resting on something.
; This sets the menu wait to 0 and the hover wait to 100 ms (not lower: very short hover times
; make thumbnails and tooltips flicker). It only changes how the desktop feels, not game speed.
; Takes effect after you sign out and in again. Undo: menu 7, then 20.
[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Control Panel\Desktop]
"MenuShowDelay"="0"

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Control Panel\Mouse]
"MouseHoverTime"="100"
